    "body": "We can fix Web IDL.\r\n\r\nAs for MDN's problem, they've had a big issue with bad documentation for prototype methods for a long time. They need to fix it. `TextEncoder.decode()` has always meant a static method (which hasn't existed); `TextEncoder.prototype.decode()` or `textEncoder.decode()` are how you write the instance methods.",
    "author_association": "MEMBER",
    "pin": null,
